WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
LOCKWOOD: Yes-- I'm sorry--
STUDENT: It's written. 
00:00:21.000-00:00:25.000
Thank you for speaking to us. 
00:00:23.000-00:00:31.000
What you're saying seems to depend on an idea of order, 
00:00:31.000-00:00:35.000
and order between members of a community
00:00:35.000-00:00:39.000
and an order between a community and god. 
00:00:39.000-00:00:43.000
I was wondering-- and it seems like your idea of
00:00:43.000-00:00:45.000
focusing only on objective rights
00:00:45.000-00:00:48.000
is also to kind of ensure that a community can
00:00:48.000-00:00:51.000
remain itself even when it
00:00:51.000-00:00:53.000
interacts with other communities.
00:00:53.000-00:00:56.000
But in a situation where two communities come
00:00:56.000-00:00:59.000
together, and they have to reorder within themselves
00:00:59.000-00:01:04.000
and some of the rights that they see as objective
00:01:04.000-00:01:09.000
differ, what happens? What
00:01:09.000-00:01:11.000
approach would Christianity take to
00:01:11.000-00:01:14.000
this situation? What
00:01:14.000-00:01:18.000
would you-- what's the result?

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:23.479
LOCKWOOD: That-- it seems to me

00:01:23.479 --> 00:01:28.240
there are no--

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:32.780
there are no quick fixes in the political realm. That is to say, in a sense I can't answer

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:35.140
your question because I don't know.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.810
What would happen would entirely depend on

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:41.210
the-- whether one was 

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:46.320
a very much minority community, whether they were more or less equal,

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.389
you know, in their population

00:01:48.389 --> 00:01:53.949
so that there had to be a-- I mean, I assume you are now talking about a

00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:57.780
political situation, because there would be
no other reason why they would have

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.020
to,

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.299
as it were-- as their right--

00:02:01.299 --> 00:02:03.950
that their

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.800
conceptions of objective goods would be endangered by--

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:13.800
by other communities. Is that right? Have I got that--
STUDENT: Yes, but if it's political and--

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.651
LOCKWOOD: Yes--
STUDENT: --the political arises from the social, and so--

00:02:15.749 --> 00:02:18.170
LOCKWOOD: Oh know that, but

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.789
how do they do live together in the political society is the--

00:02:21.789 --> 00:02:23.160
and so

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:27.250
I just wanted to--that was just a clarification
of what you were getting at.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.669
So I would go back to 

00:02:28.669 --> 00:02:33.340
"I don't know."

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:39.730
If the two communities were perhaps about
equal in population, they 

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.689
might have to 

00:02:41.689 --> 00:02:44.659
have somewhat different legal systems. 

00:02:44.659 --> 00:02:51.010
There might be-- as, for instance, I think

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:55.769
has been the case but is progresively
less so in India,

00:02:55.769 --> 00:02:57.620
accommodating

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.540
different communities.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.480
At certain levels

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.749
you know, so if

00:03:03.749 --> 00:03:05.720
it's a federal system, then

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:12.720
where different community laws are 
affected would 

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:15.949
depend on the

00:03:15.949 --> 00:03:17.590
level which these

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.909
problems arise. 

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:23.679
The-- there is a common good

00:03:23.679 --> 00:03:26.710
that in the political society--

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:32.380
if it wants to stay together as political
society-- there is a common political good

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.590
which is going to

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.069
require 

00:03:36.069 --> 00:03:38.779
a rather delicate

00:03:38.779 --> 00:03:42.269
negotiation

00:03:42.269 --> 00:03:43.729
of communal goods. 

00:03:43.729 --> 00:03:49.970
When it's a matter of
a small minority,

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:53.569
they may well be protected

00:03:53.569 --> 00:03:56.229
as much as possible

00:03:56.229 --> 00:03:59.319
within

00:03:59.319 --> 00:04:00.300
public law

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.899
in terms of the

00:04:02.899 --> 00:04:07.690
internal workings of the community but not
have

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:09.359
public representation.

00:04:09.359 --> 00:04:13.569
I'm speaking now very much as a person from
the British isles, where some

00:04:13.569 --> 00:04:19.680
religious institutions do have
public representation and others don't.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:22.019
Different political systems handle that

00:04:22.019 --> 00:04:23.380
differently, but do you see

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:29.639
the point, in a sense, I'm making in 
relation to your question, that

00:04:29.639 --> 00:04:30.719
there is--

00:04:30.719 --> 00:04:34.379
there is no one way

00:04:34.379 --> 00:04:35.900
of handling it,

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:42.110
but i think that what I would call the ideology
of egalitarian rights, in which all 

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.819
individuals and all communities have be treated--

00:04:44.819 --> 00:04:45.980
treated equally

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.060
to be respected equally

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.210
is--

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:52.860
is in many societies not on,

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.740
and not a good idea, and doesn't actually 
serve the common good. 

